[{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（……嗯……呜呜……）」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（咦……怎么回事？我刚才在做什么？）」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"想不起睡着之前的事了。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我好像是和往常一样睡着了？","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我不由地想坐起身子，但却动弹不得。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（这……难道又是鬼压床？）」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"连续两天这样……是怎么回事呢？","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"就在我纳闷的时候，背后突然窜过一阵凉意。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"和昨天一样。房间的角落有诡异的气息。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（这股气息，难道和昨天一样――！？）」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（果然是祟神！？）」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[{"asset":"a271","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"？？？","text":"『好恨……好恨……好恨，好恨，好恨，好恨，好恨……』","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[{"asset":"a271","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"？？？","text":"『不可饶恕……不可饶恕……不可饶恕……』","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[{"asset":"a271","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"？？？","text":"『我要诅咒你……我要诅咒你……我要诅咒你……我要诅咒你……我要诅咒你……我要诅咒你，我要诅咒你，我要诅咒你――』","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[{"asset":"a271","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（――唔，可恶）」","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"仇恨的“声音”像之前一样朝我涌来，好像要将我压垮。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然我像上次一样急急忙忙地想顶回去，但是手边没有丛雨丸。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"而且身体也动不了。","art":{"background":"a1340","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我只能眼睁睁地看着自己被漆黑的怨念所吞没――","art":{"background":"a0","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「――啊！？……呼，呼，呼，呼……」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我一下子坐起身子，慌张地环视房间内部。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"但还是没有祟神。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"朝武也在身边睡得香甜。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「果然是做梦啊……但为什么两天连续做这样的梦……」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"这种偶然可能发生吗？","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果……这不是单纯的偶然」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果这个梦是有意义的……那么犬神的怨恨果然还有残留，而且还不是一丁半点」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「否则就不能解释为什么会做这样的梦……」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"果然是宿体的原因。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"因为宿体，朝武才痛苦不已。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"想到这里，后悔与憎恨便涌上我的心头。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「嗯……呼……呼……嗯，呼……」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我再次观察朝武的情况，她的呼吸似乎显得有点痛苦。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「难道说！？」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我慢慢地将手贴在她的额头上，有点发烫。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「发烧……」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"难道是……身体已经开始衰弱了……？","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果没有让宿体恢复完整」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果没有增强宿体的力量，朝武就不会如此痛苦……」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「只要没有那个宿体……」","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"这种近似于仇恨的念头盘踞在我的心头。","art":{"background":"a202","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人，你醒了啊」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a130","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a130","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「你怎么了，主人？连衣服都不换。而且……」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1353","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨的视线停留在我右手握着的丛雨丸上。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1353","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她的眼睛眯成了一条线，似乎有所警惕。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「你看起来杀气很重啊。连丛雨丸都拿出来是想干什么？」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a312","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「有件事想让你帮忙」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a312","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「得看是什么事」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a134","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我想让你附身在丛雨丸上。我想要借助你的力量」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a134","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人，你到底想干什么？」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"可能是从我身上散发的气息上感觉到了什么，小雨的声音变得严厉起来。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是我没有害怕。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我现在没心思去想这些。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我要再次打碎宿体」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我直勾勾地盯着小雨，斩钉截铁地说道。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「梦话就留到梦里去说吧，主人」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a134","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我做了一个梦」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a134","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是祟神的梦。但那个祟神的气息和存在感绝对无法单纯用梦来解释」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a141","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「诅咒……果然还没有结束」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a141","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「如果放着不管，朝武开始衰弱的话一切都晚了」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a141","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「所以你要再一次打碎宿体？」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a549","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主人，你好好想想，你说的话是有多么愚蠢」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a134","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我知道」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a134","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「不，你不明白。若是打碎宿体，这次连主人都会受到跟巫女一样的诅咒的」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我不在乎！」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「这不是你在不在乎的问题！这么做是没意义的，你为什么就是不明白！」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「有意义！至少若是削弱诅咒，她就能活下去」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"朝武说了……她想活下去。她说想和我一起活下去。为此我……","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「……这……本座明白你的心情。确实，两人在一起的时光是无可替代的」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a293","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「但是，主人！以这种方法得到的时光只会让芳乃更加痛苦而已！」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「因为自己的原因害得主人被诅咒，难道她不会觉得自己有责任吗！？」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a384","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「只要不告诉她就行了」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a384","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「她怎么可能不发现宿体破碎的事情！」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a134","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨没有退缩，她逼近了我。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a134","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是我也没有害怕。我们俩正面对峙着。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a134","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「芳乃说过“想和主人一起活下去”对吧」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a141","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「难道你想让芳乃背着思想包袱度过这段时间吗？」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「――但是！那对耳朵已经没法消除了啊！」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「你这样无异于火上浇油！心急吃不了热豆腐！」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不试试看怎么知道！」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「你这……蠢货！给本座适可而止！」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a312","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨伸出手想要揪住我的前襟。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a312","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"在那一瞬――","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a312","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨・将臣","text":"『―――！？』","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a274","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"有什么像是电流一样的东西，“啪嗤”地闪了一下。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a274","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「刚、刚才的是！？」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a549","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「你……你做了什么，主人」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a274","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也不知道。你也明白这是第一次发生这样的事吧」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a274","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「而且我完全没有咒术的知识！用不出什么奇怪的力量」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a274","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「这确实没错。但不可能无故产生那样的反应……」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a188","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「而且刚才的反应和污秽相近……难道！？」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a283","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「怎、怎么了？」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a283","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「不要动！」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a274","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我还没来得及回答，小雨就展开了双臂，在下一瞬间——","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a274","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她就像是相扑力士使出“猫骗”一样，在我的眼前击掌，双手合十。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a274","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「——！？！？？」","art":{"background":"a126","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"一阵即使闭上眼睛，还是会在视野中留下烙印的耀眼光芒向我袭来。","art":{"background":"a126","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「（这是小雨的神力！？但她为什么突然这么做——）」","art":{"background":"a126","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"她的行动让我不知所措。","art":{"background":"a126","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"但同时又发生了不可思议的事情。","art":{"background":"a126","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"就像是附身在我身上的恶灵消失了一般……大脑一瞬间冷静下来。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"紧接着涌上心头的是自我厌恶。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我……为什么……」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「为什么一心想去打碎宿体呢……？」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨说得没错。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽说没时间优哉游哉地等下去……但我要去干的事是有多么愚蠢。","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"这武断的行动只会让事态更加麻烦……","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「……看来你恢复原样了，真是太好了」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a185","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是啊，我为什么会这么想呢……我或许是有点想不开了」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a185","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「可能也有这个原因，但不仅如此」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a141","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……？」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a141","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「现在本座搞清楚原因了」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a312","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「一切原因都在于附身在主人身上的怨念」","art":{"background":"a118","sprites":[{"asset":"a1175","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"5-5"}]